+# card — the one card page
 
-A padded surface with a heading and text. A `ui/` template: copy the markup from [its page](/framework/ui/card/).
+## What
 
-Code: `page.js` in this folder.
+The one card page for the site: [`/framework/ui/card/`](/framework/ui/card/). A card
